   "id": "OSC-2",
   "title": "The alternatives of every other choice are stated as a union set",
   "why": "These classes and groups have `modelGroup` `choice` without being \u00abunion\u00bbs, so a document gives exactly one of their elements, while a UML reader sees independent properties. The OWL target and the SHACL then require every alternative at once, which rejects every conforming document that uses one. `SC_UNION_SET` on the ends of the alternatives states the choice.",
   "schema": "unchanged: ASAM's generator does not read `SC_UNION_SET`",
